stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> BOOKED
    BOOKED --> CHECKED_IN : dispatcher check-in
    BOOKED --> CANCELLED : customer 24h+ before, or dispatcher
    BOOKED --> NO_SHOW : start + 30 min grace
    CHECKED_IN --> IN_PROGRESS : start work
    CHECKED_IN --> CANCELLED : dispatcher
    IN_PROGRESS --> ON_HOLD : waiting for parts
    ON_HOLD --> IN_PROGRESS : resume
    IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : finish
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    NO_SHOW --> [*]
